      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَفْصَفَةٌ</span></b>  [fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَفْصَفٌ</span>, q. v. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also] <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكْبَاجَةٌ</span> [n. un. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكبَاجٌ</span>, q. v., i. e., <i>A mess of the
kind of food thus called</i>]; (AA, O, K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَفْصَافَةٌ</span></b> , (O, K,) which is of the dial. of
