    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  And <i>A certain insect</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُوَيْبَّة</span>,
Lth, M, O), <i>by the Persians</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَجَم</span>) <i>called the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِيسَك</span> [i. e. <i>weevil</i>]: (Lth, O:) a word adventitious to the Arabic language. (Lth, M, O.)

